        <mxCell id="0hlTdycuqXmVdKRhDdZF-1" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Logger&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;The logger can also be done with producer consumer of messages,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;but it might result it some more overhead in terms of timing.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
